<article class="env-lemma" id="0BIJ">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0BIJ">Lemma <span data-tag="0BIJ">9.20.5</span>.</a> Let $M/L/K$ be a tower of finite extensions of fields. Then </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \text{Trace}_{M/K} = \text{Trace}_{L/K} \circ \text{Trace}_{M/L} \quad \text{and}\quad \text{Norm}_{M/K} = \text{Norm}_{L/K} \circ \text{Norm}_{M/L}  \]
</div>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Think of $M$ as a vector space over $L$ and apply Lemma <a href="/tag/0BII" data-tag="0BII">9.20.4</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>